ctVal=op==='+'?a+b:a-b;\n    curQ={text:a+' '+op+' '+b+' = ?'};\n    let set=new Set([correctVal]);\n    while(set.size<4){let o=correctVal+Math.floor(Math.random()*10)-5;if(o>=0&&o!==correctVal)set.add(o);}\n    choices=[...set];\n  } else {\n    let w=WORDS[Math.floor(Math.random()*WORDS.length)];\n    correctVal=w.ko;\n    curQ={text:w.en+' 의 뜻은?'};\n    let set=new Set([correctVal]);\n    while(set.size<4){let o=WORDS[Math.floor(Math.random()*WORDS.length)].ko;set.add(o);}\n    choices=[...set];\n  }\n  choices=shuffle(choices);\n  curQ.choices=choices;\n  curQ.correctIdx=choices.indexOf(correctVal);\n  selected=0;timeLeft=15000;botDecided=false;botTimer=300+Math.random()*4000;\n}\n\nfunction startGame(){\n  phase='playing';qIndex=0;correct=0;streak=0;score=0;\n  genQ();\n  if(window.AJ)AJ.start();\n}\nfunction answer(){\n  if(phase!=='playing')return;\n  let ok=selected===curQ.correctIdx;\n  if(ok){correct++;streak++;score+=10+streak*2;}else{streak=0;}\n  if(window.AJ)AJ.score(score);\n  qIndex++;\n  if(qIndex>=30){\n    if(correct>=25){phase='cleared';if(window.AJ)AJ.clear(score);}\n    else{phase='over';if(window.AJ)AJ.over(score);}\n  } else genQ();\n}\nfunction timeUp(){\n  streak=0;qIndex++;\n  if(qIndex>=30){\n    if(correct>=25){phase='cleared';if(window.AJ)AJ.clear(score);}\n    else{phase='over';if(window.AJ)AJ.over(score);}\n  } else genQ();\n}\n\nlet last=performance.now();\nfunction loop(t){\n  let dt=t-last;last=t;\n  if(phase==='playing'){\n    timeLeft-=dt;\n    if(botOn){\n      botTimer-=dt;\n      if(botTimer<=0&&!botDecided){\n        botDecided=true;\n        if(Math.random()<skill)selected=curQ.correctIdx;\n        else{let o=Math.floor(Math.random()*4);selected=o;}\n      }\n      if(botDecided&&botTimer<-200)answer();\n    }\n    if(timeLeft<=0)timeUp();\n  }\n  draw();\n  requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n}\nfunction draw(){\n  let W=cv.width,H=cv.height;\n  ctx.fillStyle='#111';ctx.fillRect(0,0,W,H);\n  let cx=W/2;\n  ctx.textAlign='center'